OL,3,GNEWSACharge dropped against cleaner
OL,4,Aafter town disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe criminal case against a Serco
OL,7,Fcleaner who was charged following
OL,8,Fanti-immigration disorder in Thetford
OL,9,Fhas been dropped, said Norfolk Police.
OL,11,FHouses on five streets in the town were
OL,12,Ftargeted by crowds over three nights
OL,13,Fearlier this month.
OL,15,FJames Jobson, 62, from Highlow Road in
OL,16,FCostessey, near Norwich, had appeared
OL,17,Fat Ipswich Magistrates' Court on Monday
OL,18,Fcharged with misconduct in public
OL,19,Foffice over the sharing of the
OL,20,Fproperties' addresses.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
