OL,3,GNEWSACharge dropped against cleaner
OL,4,Aafter town disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut police said on Friday that
OL,7,F"officers identified additional
OL,8,Fevidence which undermined the case",
OL,9,Fand "it was concluded that the legal
OL,10,Ftest for prosecution was no longer
OL,11,Fmet".
